From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RiPetitor <ripetitor@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:57:13 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] clk: rockchip: rk3568: Add low-resolution HDMI clocks

Add pixel clocks for standard VGA, SVGA and XGA modes.
Retain all existing HPLL rates and the tested 31.5 MHz setting.

Use a separate HPLL table for the fractional 25.175 and 25.2 MHz rates.
NPLL and VPLL support only integer mode.

These additional modes need hardware testing.

Signed-off-by: RiPetitor <ripetitor@proton.me>
---
 drivers/clk/rockchip/clk-rk3568.c | 82 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 81 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

